<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28482" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρῡμός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>copse, thicket,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				1399
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				57.28
			</span></i> (Milet., v. B.C.), <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				1127
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tab.Heracl.</u>
				1.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLille</u>
				5.13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ec.</u>
				2.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				2.15.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.544
			</span></i>, etc.: pl., <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				304.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				1.117
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.13
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				9.4
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Cyllen.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				84
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Antiphan.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Comp.Per.Fab.</u>
				1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> has only pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρῠμά, τά,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				11.118
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				10.150
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				197
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				251
			</span></i>, also in <i><span class="en">
				Simm.
				15
			</span></i> (prob.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρῡμά</span> in late 
				Ep.
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.P.
				492
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				1.64
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρυμός: φρούριον,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, perh. in this sense in <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				2p.140
			</span></i>. (Cf. Skt.<i>drumá</i>- 'tree',
				Slav.<i>dr[ucaron]m[ucaron]</i> 'thicket': <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ</span> is original, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῡ</span> borrowed from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρῦς.</span>)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
